;list=3DPL4DUfomz2RZwqt51oQ6oQUMYhUAqHJsse&amp;index=3D5" class=3D"external=
-link" rel=3D"nofollow">How To Perform Record Resolution-HL7 JIRA</a></span=
></p>
      <p><span><a href=3D"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DgB1t5X-7cG4&amp=
;list=3DPL4DUfomz2RZwqt51oQ6oQUMYhUAqHJsse&amp;index=3D6" class=3D"external=
-link" rel=3D"nofollow">How To Perform Triage-HL7 JIRA</a></span></p>
